# Version control covers code (02) and documents (01). Research data, models,
# backups and imports stay out of git; only their README files are tracked.

# Python and Node environments, caches and build output
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
02_主程式碼/web/dist/
02_主程式碼/web/test-results/
02_主程式碼/runtime/
*.cache
*.log
*.lock

# Secrets (LINE keys); the template .env.example is tracked
.env

# The original project report may contain patient images
*.docx

# Data areas: folders are walked so their README files can be tracked
03_模型與影像資料/**
!03_模型與影像資料/**/
!03_模型與影像資料/**/README.md
# Old copies of code and data (their READMEs belong to those copies, not to this project)
03_模型與影像資料/runtime/code_backups/
03_模型與影像資料/archive/code_backups/
03_模型與影像資料/archive/legacy/
# Old backups waiting for the project owner to delete; they hold patient data
03_模型與影像資料/待你刪除/
04_備份/**
!04_備份/**/
!04_備份/**/README.md
05_匯入區/**
!05_匯入區/**/
!05_匯入區/**/README.md
!05_匯入區/範本/**

